Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:18.50,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 1: Hook
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have you ever kept trying, even when nobody listened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.77,0:00:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today's story is about a man who kept trying...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:10.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,for nine hundred and fifty years!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:17.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the story of Prophet Nuh, peace be upon him, and the great ark, from the Holy Quran.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.50,0:00:42.62,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 2: The people forget Allah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:25.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Long, long ago, people lived in a beautiful land full of gardens and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:29.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,But they forgot Allah, the One who gave them everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:35.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,They made statues of stone, and named them Wadd, Suwa, Yaghuth, Yauq, and Nasr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.49,0:00:41.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,They prayed to them, even though statues cannot see, hear, or help anyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.62,0:01:16.38,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 3: Nuh's message
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.62,0:00:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So Allah sent a kind and patient messenger from among them: Nuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.43,0:00:51.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nuh said: O my people, worship Allah alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.66,0:00:55.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ask your Lord to forgive you, for He is always Forgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.93,0:01:02.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,He will send you rain from the sky, and give you wealth, children, gardens, and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,He told them: Look at the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:08.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Allah made the moon a light, and the sun a shining lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:14.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at the earth, spread out for you like a carpet, with wide paths to walk on.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.38,0:01:44.25,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 4: They would not listen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.38,0:01:20.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nuh called his people by night, and by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,He spoke loudly to crowds, and quietly to people one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:32.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,But they put their fingers in their ears, and covered themselves with their clothes, so they would not hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.90,0:01:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Did Nuh give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.08,0:01:34.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:37.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,He kept trying for nine hundred and fifty years!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:39.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,And he never asked for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.97,0:01:42.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,He said: My reward is only from Allah.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.25,0:02:10.12,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 5: Kindness to everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:47.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only a few people believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.31,0:01:49.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many of them were poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.06,0:01:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The proud chiefs laughed: Only the lowest of us follow you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.55,0:01:56.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,They wanted Nuh to send them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.14,0:02:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Nuh said: I will never drive away those who believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.40,0:02:03.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,To Allah, the best person is not the richest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:06.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is the one with the best heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.42,0:02:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,So let's be kind to everyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.12,0:02:34.88,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 6: Building the ark
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:20.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then Allah told Nuh that no more of his people would believe, and said: Build the ship, under Our eyes, and with Our guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.10,0:02:26.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,So Nuh built a huge ship of wooden planks and nails, on dry land, far from any sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.01,0:02:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every time the chiefs walked past, they made fun of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:33.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Nuh kept working, trusting Allah completely.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.88,0:03:00.88,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 7: All aboard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:40.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then Allah's command came, and water burst up from the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:50.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Allah said: Carry in the ship a pair of every kind of animal, your family, except those who refused to believe, and the believers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Nuh said: Climb aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:54.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bismillahi majraha wa mursaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.49,0:02:59.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the name of Allah it sails, and in the name of Allah it stops.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.88,0:03:38.88,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 8: The great flood
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.88,0:03:08.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,The gates of the sky opened with pouring rain, and springs burst from the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:11.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,The ark sailed through waves as big as mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.81,0:03:17.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nuh saw his own son standing apart, and called: O my son, come with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.23,0:03:20.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,But his son said: I will climb a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.44,0:03:22.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will keep me safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:28.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nuh replied: Today nothing can save anyone from Allah's command, except His mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.31,0:03:32.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then a wave came between them, and his son was not saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.66,0:03:35.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mountains and strength cannot save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:37.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only Allah's mercy can.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.88,0:03:59.00,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 9: Peace returns
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:43.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then it was said: O earth, swallow your water!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.35,0:03:45.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,O sky, hold back your rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.39,0:03:49.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The water went down, and the ark came to rest on Mount Judi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:57.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Allah said: O Nuh, come down in peace from Us, with blessings on you, and on the believers with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.00,0:04:30.38,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 10: The lessons
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.00,0:04:03.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Allah left this story as a sign for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:05.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, will we remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.11,0:04:08.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,What did we learn from Prophet Nuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.09,0:04:12.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,One: never give up doing good, and be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.01,0:04:15.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Two: be kind to every person, rich or poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:19.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Three: trust Allah, even when others laugh at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.93,0:04:25.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's say Nuh's beautiful dua together: Rabbighfir li wa li walidayya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Lord, forgive me and my parents.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.38,0:04:42.62,Label,,0,0,0,,PREVIZ  ·  Scene 11: Outro
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:37.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,This week's Kindness Challenge: be patient with someone, even when it's hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:39.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,See you next time, on Toon Noon!
